Z||000011||Joe Torma||09-02-2001||10:13 PM||||<B>The form will be ready Monday morning with further instructions!</B><P>I will work on the pages in the order I get your form...prepare a writeup for your page if you'd like, otherwise you'll just have pictures and specs.<P>Ideas for writeups:<BR>-How you "met" your car<BR>-Buildup stories<BR>-Great kill stories<BR>-Summary of mods, and future mods.<BR>Or whatever.<P>Specs for the photos will be on the form page...anything you've been posting to the forum is ok, but I'd like 1 nice big image of your car, with other smaller images.<P>I will be emailing you a proof of your page(s) before I print, for you to ok.<P>I will add more specific boxes for engine and a couple of other things.<P>I got some suggestions from Fierosound for a name, I'll post those later,come up with some ideas and we'll vote.<P>Thanks!<BR>Joe<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000012||Joe Torma||09-03-2001||04:57 AM||||Ok, boys and girls... <A HREF="http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm</A> <P>I hope you will all help make this a success!<P>Looking forward to your entries,<BR>Joe<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/simplesig.gif"> <BR>Did you get your car in my book yet????<BR>http://www.animatedconcepts.com/fierobook.htm||||reg||1
