Z||000020||Fiero5||09-03-2001||09:25 PM||||"I would appreciate your input..."<P>1)What should we call the book?<BR>The Pontiac Fiero Lovers Pictorial<P>2)Anything else to include on the form<BR>Fiero art<P>3)Any other ideas<BR>I would hope that those who have done a little or alot of work on their Fieros,<BR>will submit before, during as well as after pics. Also, some of these cars have really unique features like chopped tops, inlaid hood scoops, see thru panels, aftermarket dashes and so on. I hope that they will include close ups of these unique features.<BR>And try to have some unique angles or backdrops of your rides too if at all possible.<P>Just some thoughts.<P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero1sunburst.jpg.jpg">            <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
Z||000021||Joe Torma||09-04-2001||03:08 PM||||<B><BR>1)What should we call the book?<BR>The Pontiac Fiero Lovers Pictorial</B><P>I like...I'm keeping a list of suggestions.<P><B>2)Anything else to include on the form<BR>Fiero art</B><P>Absolutely...if you have some drawings or whatever send them in an email to me.<P><B>3)Any other ideas<BR>I would hope that those who have done a little or alot of work on their Fieros,<BR>will submit before, during as well as after pics. Also, some of these cars have really unique features like chopped tops, inlaid hood scoops, see thru panels, aftermarket dashes and so on. I hope that they will include close ups of these unique features.<BR>And try to have some unique angles or backdrops of your rides too if at all possible.<BR></B><P>Exactly what I'd like to see!  The more good pictures you have, the better the page I can make for you.<P>Only a few submissions so far.<P>||||reg||7
